            "review_text": "Acojesticlady\nBangkok, Thailand61 contributions\n0\nMy First 5 Stars after 4 Vietnam Cities. A must eat!\nSep 2024 • Family\nOh my goodness. I’ve been traveling through Vietnam, starting in Hanoi, and arrived in Da Nang by train. Starving, since I couldn’t find anything in Hanoi that fit my picky food preferences, I stumbled upon what I thought was a kids' fun zone across from my hotel. As we walked in, we quickly realized it wasn’t a play area at all, but a food spot, and the irresistible aroma made us stay.\n\nThe place—and the staff—are simply wonderful. As one of the pickiest eaters, it took me about 20 minutes to decide on my order. But, to my surprise, it didn’t even matter. The waitstaff came to the table with a spread of appetizers and an array of meats for us to try, none of which we ordered. When I mentioned that, they smiled and said it was all complimentary. There was so much food that I almost felt guilty accepting it—but I’m so glad I did.\n\nThe mushrooms were sautéed to absolute perfection. I never imagined I’d enjoy Vietnamese noodles, and much to my surprise, I’ve been missing out. The sweet vinaigrette that lingers on the back of your tongue was unlike anything I’ve ever tasted. The soups were rich and buttery with the perfect hint of fish flavor. And the aroma? Mouthwatering.\n\nYou can tell the manager truly invests his heart into this restaurant—the waitstaff and chefs didn’t miss a single beat. Beyond the delicious food, what stood out to me was the cleanliness of the restaurant. Whether you look up, down, left, or right, everything is spotless, leaving you completely at ease.\n\nI was beyond stuffed after my meal, but I stayed an extra 30 minutes simply because the atmosphere was so warm and inviting. The smiles from the staff and the comfortable vibe made it impossible to leave.\n\nThis is easily a 5-star restaurant in my book, and considering 98% of my reviews are 3 stars or less, that’s saying something. If you’re ever in Da Nang, do yourself a favor and don’t miss this place.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nDo not miss out!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 22, 2024\nhanmaeum\nHANMAEUM BBQ xin chân thành cảm ơn quý khách đã ghé ủng hộ và dành lời khen ấn tượng đến nhà hàng. Chúng tôi sẽ tiếp tục nổ lực hơn nữa để mang lại những trải nghiệm tốt nhất cho quý khách. Hẹn gặp lại quý khách vào ngày gần nhất!\nRead more\nWritten November 23, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
